  "contentHtml": "<p>안녕하세요 암석을 모두 표본으로 배운 후 학교 암석찾기를 해보려고 합니다.</p><p>그 흔한 편마암도 학교에는 없고</p><p>아래 암석들만 가득 있어요</p><p>전공이 아니라서 이름을 잘 모르는 암석이 너무 많아서 도움을 요청합니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>1번: 바닥에 너무 많아요 . 이름이 뭔지 모르겠어요</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1847d5b8cc5c1d7a539debc78c36434c2fee20a2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1847d5b8cc5c1d7a539debc78c36434c2fee20a2\" data-origin-width=\"1400\" data-origin-height=\"1050\"></div><p>2번: 편암? 편마암</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e4088ce94ed712c8c3f9d6f0b949631141bf075d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e4088ce94ed712c8c3f9d6f0b949631141bf075d\" data-origin-width=\"1400\" data-origin-height=\"1050\"></div><p>3번 : 구멍이 뚫려 있고 어두워서 현무암?</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f4dc8c2107397dc41e3a6821004bb5322c67df3e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f4dc8c2107397dc41e3a6821004bb5322c67df3e\" data-origin-width=\"1400\" data-origin-height=\"1050\"></div><p>4번: 화강암??</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d84a1672461ff90e2e59fc9d718497b4a6fd38c6\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d84a1672461ff90e2e59fc9d718497b4a6fd38c6\" data-origin-width=\"1400\" data-origin-height=\"1050\"></div><p>5번: 정원에 가득 있어요. 이 암석은 어떤 암석일까요?</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7008fa2667b4c0b065e60cb4315f5f18f845a164\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7008fa2667b4c0b065e60cb4315f5f18f845a164\" data-origin-width=\"1400\" data-origin-height=\"1050\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
